    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Team_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Team Feats\">Team Feats</a></i></p><p>You and your allies train on the sheer cliffs of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Teth\" title=\"Teth\">Teth</a> and the sinkholes of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Utapau\" title=\"Utapau\">Utapau</a> as a matter of course.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">Climb</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +3 competence bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">Climb</a> checks. At the time you make a check, for each ally within 12 squares of you who also has this Feat, the competence bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +7).</p><p>Additionally, when you climb, you climb at half your speed as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> (or at your normal speed as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>).</p>",
